anywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1721846/b3121541-792b-47ad-8a55-312d6d96dad9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1721846/b3121541-792b-47ad-8a55-312d6d96dad9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1721846/b3121541-792b-47ad-8a55-312d6d96dad9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1721846/b3121541-792b-47ad-8a55-312d6d96dad9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1721846/b3121541-792b-47ad-8a55-312d6d96dad9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1721846/b3121541-792b-47ad-8a55-312d6d96dad9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Gemütliche, voll möblierte 2‐Zimmer‐Wohnung mit Terrasse in ruhiger Sackgasse im Grünen, zentral in Herzogenaurach. Ideal für Wochenpendler oder Neuankömmlinge. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten fußläufig erreichbar. Sehr gute Anbindung an Schaeffler (zu Fuß), PUMA (Fuß/Fahrrad), adidas (Fahrrad/Bus); Erlangen per Bus erreichbar.\nAusstattung:\nWohn-/Essbereich mit Schlafsofa & Esstisch (4 Pers.), Schlafzimmer mit Schrank (optional Bett 1,40 m), voll ausgestattete Küche (Backofen, Mikrowelle), Tageslichtbad mit Badewanne/Dusche & Waschmaschine. Flur mit Garderobe. Kellerraum vorhanden. Möblierte Terrasse, Fahrradabstellung möglich.\nHinweise: nur möbliert, Nichtraucher, Mindestmietdauer 6 Monate, NK vom Mieter anzumelden, Endreinigung 150 €, Fotos auf Anfrage.\n\nCentral & Quiet Furnished 2‐Room Apartment in Herzogenaurach\n43 sqm | Terrace | Basement | available approx. June\nFully furnished apartment in a quiet green cul‐de‐sac, centrally located. Ideal for weekly commuters or newcomers. Shops nearby. Easy access to Schaeffler, PUMA, adidas, Erlangen by bus.\nLiving area with sofa bed & dining table, bedroom with wardrobe (optional 1.40 m bed), fully equipped kitchen, daylight bathroom with washer, basement storage, furnished terrace (bike storage possible).\nNotes: furnished only, non‐smoking, min. 6 months, utilities paid by tenant, final cleaning €150, photos on request.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"43"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"no"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":82500,"deposit":247500,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"825.00","deposit":"2475.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2027-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-08-26T04:48:01Z","__utId__":"ut1721846"},{"id":"1730855","rank":184,"rating":0,"publish